  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">스티로폼공을 매달고 털가죽으로 문지른 플라스틱 막대(-)대전체를 대면 밀려나더라구요 정전기 유도 현상이 적용되려면 끌려와야하지 않나요? 은박구는 끌려오던데 스티로폼공은 밀려나네요..절연체는 유전분극의 형태로 정전기가 유도 된다고 하는데 그럼에도 불구하고 밀려나는건 뭘까요?<br>근데 크기가 작은 스티로폼공은 끌려오던데요..</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvrusehplzi2ji8b98stc3jxp@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1920\" data-video-height=\"1080\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvrusehplzi2ji8b98stc3jxp/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33207541979&amp;signature=EjF8A%2B9lLmnv9UCI5QyKuoZnw1E%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1920\" data-video-origin-height=\"1080\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvrusehplzi2ji8b98stc3jxp?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2cnVzZWhwbHppMmppOGI5OHN0YzNqeHAiLCJ0aWQiOiJlNDgxNDExYS00NWViLTQwMmUtYTYyYi0xYmY4ZGViODlmYjYiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODE5NTd9.SMS-fhb-BgMCpWwUaoFCkFm9FBaFiNfUK4CQfgdXRLh8AOXvrvdLA5yWJDBMWij1kwU7Aeb5DPzjt4Yko2twfA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
